{"id":"bbe421fe5b2f0839","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-saturated-ideal-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Cardinal8 Saturated Ideal Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-cardinal8-saturated-ideal-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Saturated Ideal Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cardinal8-saturated-ideal-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cardinal8-saturated-ideal-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-cardinal8-saturated-ideal-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Saturated Ideal Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cardinal8-saturated-ideal-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cardinal8-saturated-ideal-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cardinal8-saturated-ideal-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Saturated Ideal Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (infinite cardinal) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (proper ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SaturatedIdealCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SaturatedIdealCardinal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SaturatedIdealCardinal}_S(\\kappa,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\kappa\\notin I\\land\\neg\\exists\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\land|\\mathcal A|&gt;\\kappa\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\ne Y\\to X\\cap Y\\in I)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SaturatedIdealCardinal}_S(\\kappa,I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\kappa\\notin I\\land\\neg\\exists\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\land|\\mathcal A|&gt;\\kappa\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\ne Y\\to X\\cap Y\\in I)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Properness is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\notin I\">\\(\\kappa\\notin I\\)</span>, because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is the top element of the Boolean algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span>; the former clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\notin I\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\notin I\\)</span> was ill-typed.</li>\n<li>The positive sets are expanded as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\)</span>, so no free symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^+\">\\(I^+\\)</span> remains. The last clause is precisely the absence of an antichain of size greater than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","